    <text>
        <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve" xml:lang="la" resp="#JSG">
                <ab>
                    <lb n="1"/><persName type="divine" key="diManes"><name><expan><abbr>D</abbr><ex>is</ex></expan></name> <name><expan><abbr>M</abbr><ex>anibus</ex></expan></name></persName>
                    <lb n="2"/><persName type="attested"><name><expan><abbr>P</abbr><ex>ubli</ex></expan></name> <name>Ateroni</name> <persName type="libertino"><name><expan><abbr>P</abbr><ex>ubli</ex></expan></name> <expan><abbr>lib</abbr><ex>erti</ex></expan></persName> <name>Chresti</name></persName>
                    <lb n="3"/><expan><abbr><num value="6">VI</num>vir</abbr><ex>i</ex></expan> et Augustalis <expan><abbr>s</abbr><ex>oci</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>c</abbr><ex>ultoris</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>omus</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>ivinae</ex></expan>
                    <lb n="4"/><persName type="attested"><name>Voltur<hi rend="ligature">ni</hi>a</name> <persName type="patronym"><name><expan><abbr>P</abbr><ex>ubli</ex></expan></name> <expan><abbr>f</abbr><ex>ilia</ex></expan></persName> <name>Apathe</name></persName> <expan><abbr>coniug</abbr><ex>i</ex></expan>
                    <lb n="5"/>eximiae caritatis et adfectio
                    <lb n="6" break="no"/><unclear>nis</unclear> in matrimonio insig<hi rend="ligature">ni</hi>s
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus">
                <listApp>
                    <app><note>Text from EDR; although cf. their restoration of line 3 as s(enatus) c(onsulto) d(ono) d(ato), which they suggest is more probable than the restoration provided here.</note></app>
                </listApp>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To the Shades of the Underworld. For Publius Ateronus Chrestus, freedman of Publius, sexvir and Augustalis, friend of the worshippers of the divine household. Volturnia Apathe, daughter of Publius, [set this up] for her husband, for his exceptional love and affection and being outstanding in marriage.</p>
            </div>
